# Crossroads open streets at right angles; the third street runs into the
# main street, where its plot is free, and closes a loop with a crossroads.
new empty
free on
construction off
build crossroads at s0:40
ride #last
turn up
ride +24
build crossroads here
ride #last
turn up
ride +24
build crossroads here
expect streets 4
# three built, one made where the third street met the main street
expect count crossroads 4
streets
map
